WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 30h: Pod approaching the Lunar Base
Duration: ~8 seconds
Source: FF8 Gameplay/Cutscene
Describes the pod's final approach to the Lunar Base space station

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
The pod streaks toward the Lunar Base. The space station is now clearly visible — a massive structure composed of interconnected modules, solar panels, and communication arrays extending from its central hub.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
The moon's surface dominates the background — a gray, crater-scarred landscape that fills half the view. The contrast between the clean technology of the Lunar Base and the raw, barren moon is striking.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The pod's trajectory brings it closer to the base. Docking ports and entry points are visible. The pod begins to slow, preparing for docking. The final seconds of the long journey from the planet are at hand.
